{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Act 12: 1789 vs 2026",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s13b01",
     "shot": "goldstone",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The political scientist Jack Goldstone spent a career studying why states break down.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Goldstone",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b02",
     "shot": "goldstone",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "His answer was that it tends to happen when three things line up.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:three",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b03",
     "shot": "conditions",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "One, the state is in a fiscal crisis and can't pay its bills.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b04",
     "shot": "conditions",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Two, the elites are divided and fighting each other.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b05",
     "shot": "conditions",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Three, a large part of the population is mobilised and angry.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b06",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Let's score both years.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       4,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b07",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "1789.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       2,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b08",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Fiscal crisis: yes, the kingdom was bankrupt.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:yes,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b09",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Elites divided: yes, the nobles blocked every reform,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:yes,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b10",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "the courts fought the king, and some nobles and priests ended up joining the Third Estate.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b11",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Mass anger: yes, hungry crowds in Paris.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:yes,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b12",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And then the fourth thing that sealed it.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "riser",
       "w:fourth",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b13",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The army split.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "impact",
       "w:split.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b14",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Units of the French Guards joined the crowd at the Bastille.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b15",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "When the people with the guns stop obeying, a government is finished.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b16",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "2026.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       2,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b17",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Fiscal crisis: arguably, but a different kind.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "blip",
       "w:arguably,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b18",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "France is not bankrupt.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b19",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Markets still lend to it, and one chief economist told Le Monde the debt",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b20",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "problem is serious but manageable, unless political instability makes it worse.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b21",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But debt at 119 percent of GDP and borrowing costs at twenty-year highs mean",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b22",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "every budget is a war.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b23",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Elites divided: yes, in a different way.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:yes,",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b24",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Parliament is split into blocs, governments keep falling,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b25",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and everyone is competing ahead of the election.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b26",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But they are competing to win the presidency, not to abolish it.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b27",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Mass anger: yes.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:yes.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b28",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Half a million marched, plus students, unions, farmers and fishermen.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b29",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But it is leaderless, its demands are mixed,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:leaderless,",
       0.3
      ],
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:mixed,",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b30",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "from schools to diesel to wages, and a violent fringe that most marchers did",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:violent",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b31",
     "shot": "score",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "not join has taken much of the attention.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b32",
     "shot": "missing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Now look at what's missing.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b33",
     "shot": "missing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "One, no defection.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:defection.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b34",
     "shot": "missing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The police and the army are doing their jobs,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b35",
     "shot": "missing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "where in 1789 they switched sides.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b36",
     "shot": "missing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Two, no alternative system on offer.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:alternative",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b37",
     "shot": "missing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Nobody is marching to abolish the republic.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b38",
     "shot": "missing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Even the loudest critics want to win the election that's already scheduled.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b39",
     "shot": "missing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In 1789, the alternative to the king had to be invented from scratch.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b40",
     "shot": "missing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And three, a legal exit exists, about six months away.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:legal",
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "sparkle",
       "w:six",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b41",
     "shot": "missing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In 1789 the only road to change was a meeting that the king didn't want to hold.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "clang",
       "w:king",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b42",
     "shot": "echoes",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But there are echoes that go beyond the checklist.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b43",
     "shot": "echoes",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In October 1789, a crowd went to Versailles because that is where the power slept.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b44",
     "shot": "echoes",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In October 2026, crowds went to town halls and prefectures.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       2,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b45",
     "shot": "great_fear",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And in 1789, the summer was swept by the Great Fear,",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b46",
     "shot": "great_fear",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "rumours that aristocrats had hired brigands to starve the villages.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       10,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b47",
     "shot": "great_fear",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Peasants armed themselves against enemies who didn't exist.",
     "date": 1789,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b48",
     "shot": "suspicion",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In 2026, every camp suspects someone else's hidden hand,",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b49",
     "shot": "suspicion",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "and foreign leaders have weighed in.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b50",
     "shot": "suspicion",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "When trust collapses, every explanation starts to sound like a plot.",
     "date": 2026,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       4,
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b51",
     "shot": "verdict",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "So is France in a revolution?",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b52",
     "shot": "verdict",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "By the historians' own checklist, not yet.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:not",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b53",
     "shot": "verdict",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And yes, the word 'yet' is doing a lot of work.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:yet",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b54",
     "shot": "hindsight",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But historians are very bad at predicting revolutions and very good at explaining them afterwards.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b55",
     "shot": "hindsight",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In May 1968, nobody on the barricades knew the system would hold either, until it did.",
     "date": 1968,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b56",
     "shot": "who_pays",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "What 2026 shares with 1789 is the cause,",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b57",
     "shot": "who_pays",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "the question of who pays when the bill comes due.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:bill",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b58",
     "shot": "who_pays",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Not, so far, the outcome.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s13b59",
     "shot": "finale",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And that question is almost two and a half centuries old.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "sparkle",
       "w:centuries",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "grand"
    }
   ],
   "mood": "grand"
  }
 ]
}